# The Vercel project's Root Directory is `website`, but the CLI uploads the
# whole repo as the deployment source — which here means the packaged desktop
# builds, and a 173MB AppImage trips Vercel's 100MB per-file limit.
# Only website/** is needed to build the site.
node_modules
dist
dist-electron
dist_electron
release
out
*.AppImage
*.deb
*.dmg
*.exe
*.flatpak
*.blockmap
*.snap
*.zip
.git
